  "details": "It's nice to see camera has more layers, but... i miss the pickup layer.\nWhy pickup layer needed? Because you can show it on stream to others you're holding something and can even used for fun acting. Now it's invisible without enviroment. And enviroment is too much to show.\n\nMy request here: please add pickup layer! It will make camera use better, especially for streamers! Or photos with transparent background, but holding pickup item, will possible.\n\nNow the camera is too much focused on players OR enviroment, and we forgot pickups can used for fun.",
